OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral of former gangland
OL,4,Aenforcer Paul Ferris takes place in
OL,5,AGlasgow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe funeral of former gangland enforcer
OL,8,FPaul Ferris has taken place in Glasgow.
OL,10,FFerris, who died earlier this month at
OL,11,Fthe age of 62, was cleared of murdering
OL,12,Fthe son of crime boss Arthur Thompson
OL,13,Fin 1992 after what was, at the time,
OL,14,Fthe longest-running murder trial in
OL,15,FScottish legal history.
OL,17,FHe was jailed for seven years in 1998
OL,18,Ffor gun-running but insisted he turned
OL,19,Fhis back on crime after being released.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
